<title>SINGAPORE: Kim Eng 1st-half profit down 14.48 pct.</title>
<headline>Kim Eng 1st-half profit down 14.48 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996 (in millions of Singapore dollars unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit				 13.89    vs     16.24</p>
<p>    Group share (cents)		     2.86    vs	3.35</p>
<p>    Turnover				   46.50    vs     53.57</p>
<p>    Other income				7.86    vs	6.97</p>
<p>    Interest expense			  1.93    vs	0.99</p>
<p>    Pretax				     12.55    vs     19.16</p>
<p>    Associates				  5.31    vs	2.99</p>
<p>    Tax					   3.84    vs	5.71</p>
<p>    Minorities				 (0.13)   vs     (0.19)</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name is Kim Eng Holdings Ltd.</p>
<p>--Singapore newsroom (65 870 3088)</p>
